  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You can accommodate one more item of a certain type than usual.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Choose one magic item slot or cybernetic slot. You may wear one additional item in that slot, gaining the benefits of all items worn.</p>\n<p><strong>Special:</strong> This feat can be selected multiple times. Each time, it applies to a different slot.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/arcforge-feats#toc1\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
